"一／二／三类描述结构类型；强／中／弱描述信号强度，对应雷达颜色深浅。类型、强度与是否确认是三个不同维度。" = "Types 1–3 describe the structure. Strong, medium and weak describe signal strength, shown by radar color depth. Type, strength and confirmation are separate dimensions.";
"三类观察离开中枢后的回抽是否留在中枢之外。本 App 还核对相关笔与均线条件，仅越过中枢边界不足以确认信号。" = "Type 3 examines whether the retrace stays outside the pivot. The app also checks stroke and moving-average conditions; crossing a pivot boundary alone does not confirm a signal.";
"下沿 ZD %@ — 上沿 ZG %@" = "Lower ZD %@ — Upper ZG %@";
"与 K 线、雷达一致：红色为买点，绿色为卖点；虚线表示未确认。" = "As on the chart and radar: red means buy signals, green means sell signals, and dashed outlines mean unconfirmed.";
"与图表、雷达一致：虚线表示未确认，不表示看空。已确认也不代表后续价格必然按预期发展。" = "As on the chart and radar, dashed lines mean unconfirmed, not bearish. Confirmation does not guarantee the subsequent price direction.";
